        "name": "USN-8759-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that WebOb incorrectly handled certain URLs. An attacker could possibly use this issue to control a redirect or forward to another URL. This issue was only addressed in Ubuntu 16.04 LTS and Ubuntu 18.04 LTS. (CVE-2024-42353)  Caleb Brown discovered that WebOb incorrectly handled certain URLs. An attacker could possibly use this issue to control a redirect or forward to another URL. (CVE-2026-44889)",
